  <item>
    <title>远行第一站丨上海</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64fc71193fa4090b74972fdb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64fc71193fa4090b74972fdb</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 09 Sep 2023 13:20:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目我们来到了魔都上海，来感受一下一线城市的忙碌。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们的行李：</span></p><span></span><p><span>包1（朋友的包）：</span></p><span></span><p><span>吃的</span></p><span></span><p><span>雨伞</span></p><span></span><p><span>钱包</span></p><span></span><p><span>充电器/线</span></p><span></span><p><span>纸（干/湿纸巾）</span></p><span></span><p><span>证件</span></p><span></span><p><span>水</span></p><span></span><p><span>包2（我的包）:</span></p><span></span><p><span>笔记本电脑</span></p><span></span><p><span>雨伞</span></p><span></span><p><span>洗漱用品</span></p><span></span><p><span>电脑配件（u/硬盘）</span></p><span></span><p><span>充电器/线</span></p><span></span><p><span>耳机</span></p><span></span><p><span>水</span></p><span></span><p><span>纸巾</span></p><span></span><p><span>行李箱（24寸）：</span></p><span></span><p><span>衣服（外/内）</span></p><span></span><p><span>电热水杯</span></p><span></span><p><span>鞋</span></p><span></span><p><span>洗漱包</span></p><span></span><p><span>一次性用品（毛巾/床单被罩）</span></p><span></span><p><span>充电宝</span></p><span></span><p><span>衣架</span></p><span></span><p><span>可随身携带的包</span></p><span></span><p><span>温馨提示：男生最好带剃须用品，女生最好带卫生用品。如果一个人去行李箱20寸就感觉已经够了，箱子太大没有用</span></p><span></span><p><span>交通方式：</span></p><span></span><p><span>去：高铁（天津出发6小时到达） 回：动卧（上海出发11小时到达）</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————————————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们拍的</span><a href="https://pan.baidu.com/s/1U-B__AMBda-iVppfPjD43A?pwd=zgsh&nbsp;" data-url="https://pan.baidu.com/s/1U-B__AMBda-iVppfPjD43A?pwd=zgsh&nbsp;"><span>照片</span></a><span>（虽然挺烂的）</span></p><span></span><p><span>————————————————-——————</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：YINDX / 小倩</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：YINDX</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmSx4ehlGaKcfIhjghyW9debEy-o.m4a" length="99259661" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:08:23</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmBr0HVyZdAXOZqtFwXeO82uRhk1.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>第三站丨天津狮子林桥（跳水大爷）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64f1ccbfe490c5dee514fbd4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64f1ccbfe490c5dee514fbd4</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 01 Sep 2023 11:36:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><span>本期节目一直在强调跳水的危险性，也请游客只看不跳，永远记住安全第一！安全第一！！安全第一！！！</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>注意事项：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>1.没有跳水基础千万不要跳！！！（有也不建议跳！！）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>2.不要在他人正在跳水的时候打搅</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>3.不要在狮子林桥上和桥下拥挤（以免发生踩踏、意外落水等情况）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>温馨提示：海河的水不干净</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgWlYmwSe4jIW8GhhHD2A5MbkGHE.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>跳水的大爷和围观群众（来源于网络）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>最后欢迎大家来天津旅游</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>主播：YINDX</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：YINDX</span></p><span></span><p><span>录制时间：23·9·1</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqPWCPMsKuPmbq7KilMCD0Yblyfy.m4a" length="45606133" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:31:25</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmBr0HVyZdAXOZqtFwXeO82uRhk1.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>第二站丨天津姚村夜市</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64da041a3fa4090b74371394</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64da041a3fa4090b74371394</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 14 Aug 2023 10:38:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>简介：</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天和大家分享的是天津姚村夜市，夜市非常热闹。</span></p><span></span><p><span>以下为出行指南</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. 可以乘坐地铁3号线大学城站B口骑行/步行到达（路程较远）.</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. 可以乘坐地铁3号线大学城站B口倒162路（健康产业园临时公交站方向）文博园站下车步行150到达.</span></p><span></span><p><span>3. 还可以乘坐公交963路师范大学西门站下车步行400米即到</span></p><span></span><p><span>4. 开车导航至 天津姚村夜市</span></p><span></span><p><span>注：如果开车需把车停在路边，或导航至最近的停车场。切勿酒后驾驶机动车上路！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>我和小董的合影</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuPmOJtiKv2fk9s-SHkTX9AA7arn.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>片头曲：徐鲤《片头曲-播出版》</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>YINDX</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：</span></p><span></span><p><span>YINDX</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpSK0FvzT4WawYlHuxuS5NKEzgCF.m4a" length="15524773" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:10:41</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmBr0HVyZdAXOZqtFwXeO82uRhk1.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>第一站丨天津高新消防主题公园</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64d23dc680c9ec4c5fb82385</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64d23dc680c9ec4c5fb82385</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 08 Aug 2023 22:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>简介：</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天和大家分享的是天津高新区消防主题公园，公园以消防为主题呈现了天津市首个消防主题公园。</span></p><span></span><p><span>以下为出行指南</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. 可以乘坐地铁3号线学府工业区站B口出向西北方向步行800米即到.</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. 可以乘坐公交638路/667路大学城方向/667路才智道方向/624路西线/862路海泰南公交站下车向方向西北步行600米即到.</span></p><span></span><p><span>3. 还可以乘坐公交620路高新区消防支队下车步行30米即到</span></p><span></span><p><span>4. 开车导航至 天津高新消防文化主题公园</span></p><span></span><p><span>注：如果开车需把车停在路边，车库为政用车库，未录入车辆不可入内</span></p><span></span><p><span>下面是现场拍摄的部分照片</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlgYczvwhUYaRjXwfKuXYPSPhWor.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhyke42IC1JOdWiASfhG19ZS9OuG.JPG"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkboji8ZDckm4v6UTLtsadnxpkaA.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>片头曲：徐鲤《片头曲-播出版》</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>YINDX 《欧岛》《出门走走·天津篇》《出门走走·中国篇》播客 主播</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期：</span></p><span></span><p><span>YINDX / 老中</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrzBGX_RB0cd0izhlaBlaHjl_fqV.m4a" length="41400209" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:28:31</itunes:duration>
